        "filing_date": "2025-10-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our “people first” mindset, we are dedicated to advancing our people strategy by developing our talent, maintaining an engaged workforce and offering programs and rewards that attract and retain the best talent.",
        "start_character": 41082,
        "end_character": 41304
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001616533-25-000061",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001616533-25-000061-c53377f766645b0f",
        "accession_number": "0001616533-25-000061",
        "filing_date": "2025-10-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For our HPC and AI products, we have developed capabilities for design and development of large-scale systems and dense HPC and AI clusters that have significant power and cooling requirements, with manufacturing and testing conducted at our Fremont, California facility.",
        "start_character": 21155,
        "end_character": 21426
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001616533-25-000061",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001616533-25-000061-c53377f766645b0f",
        "accession_number": "0001616533-25-000061",
        "filing_date": "2025-10-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For our fault tolerant products, we primarily use third-party manufacturers with assembly in our Ireland facility for certain product lines.",
        "start_character": 21014,
        "end_character": 21154
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001616533-25-000061",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001616533-25-000061-c53377f766645b0f",
        "accession_number": "0001616533-25-000061",
        "filing_date": "2025-10-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For our specialty memory products, we have developed a high-volume, fully automated reliability testing and screening capability that substantially exceeds standard industry practices.",
        "start_character": 23082,
        "end_character": 23266
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001616533-25-000061",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001616533-25-000061-c53377f766645b0f",
        "accession_number": "0001616533-25-000061",
        "filing_date": "2025-10-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In Advanced Computing, we sell our HPC and AI products to enterprise and government customers in AI cloud services, energy, financial services, hyperscale, and education;",
        "start_character": 25167,
        "end_character": 25337
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001616533-25-000061",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001616533-25-000061-c53377f766645b0f",
        "accession_number": "0001616533-25-000061",
        "filing_date": "2025-10-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We aim to develop capable leadership that can meet the challenges of business growth while instilling a supportive and inclusive company culture.",
        "start_character": 42077,
        "end_character": 42222
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001616533-25-000061",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001616533-25-000061-c53377f766645b0f",
        "accession_number": "0001616533-25-000061",
        "filing_date": "2025-10-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also design and manufacture embedded and removable flash memory products in a variety of form factors and capacities, incorporated into storage and hybrid-integrated memory solutions in standard and rugged formats.",
        "start_character": 14763,
        "end_character": 14980
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001616533-25-000061",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001616533-25-000061-c53377f766645b0f",
        "accession_number": "0001616533-25-000061",
        "filing_date": "2025-10-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide customized, integrated supply chain services for certain customers to assist them with the management and execution of their procurement and distribution processes.",
        "start_character": 24364,
        "end_character": 24544
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001616533-25-000061",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001616533-25-000061-c53377f766645b0f",
        "accession_number": "0001616533-25-000061",
        "filing_date": "2025-10-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a member of the Responsible Business Alliance (“RBA”), and our manufacturing facilities in Malaysia and California currently comply with the RBA Code of Conduct, which increasingly is a business requirement of our customers.",
        "start_character": 19577,
        "end_character": 19808
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001616533-25-000061",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001616533-25-000061-c53377f766645b0f",
        "accession_number": "0001616533-25-000061",
        "filing_date": "2025-10-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our close collaboration with customers, customer-specific designs, long-lifecycle solutions and proprietary supply chain services create significant customer value.",
        "start_character": 24545,
        "end_character": 24720
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001616533-25-000061",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001616533-25-000061-c53377f766645b0f",
        "accession_number": "0001616533-25-000061",
        "filing_date": "2025-10-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that our close collaboration with customers, customer-specific designs, long-lifecycle solutions, superior products and proprietary supply chain services create significant customer loyalty that may provide an advantage when competing against large international companies.",
        "start_character": 37515,
        "end_character": 37799
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001616533-25-000061",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001616533-25-000061-c53377f766645b0f",
        "accession_number": "0001616533-25-000061",
        "filing_date": "2025-10-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
